        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{40}{3}$",
          "worked": "By the tangent–secant form of the Power of a Point Theorem,\n$$\\begin{align*}7^2&=3(x+3)\\\\49&=3x+9\\\\3x&=40\\\\x&=\\frac{40}{3}.\\end{align*}$$",
